<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>
<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    background: #f4f7fb;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .privacy-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 50px auto;
    background: white;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .privacy-container h1 {
    color: #1e3a8a;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .updated {
    text-align: center;
    color: gray;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .privacy-container h2 {
    color: #2563eb;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .privacy-container p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .privacy-container ul {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .privacy-container li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .privacy-footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    color: gray;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .privacy-container a {
    color: #2563eb;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .privacy-container a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-container {
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 25px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="privacy-container">

  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p class="updated">
    Last Updated: May 13, 2026
  </p>

  <p>
    Welcome to <strong>WanderStay</strong>. Your privacy is important to us.
    This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your
    information when you use our website and services.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

  <p>We may collect the following information:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Name and contact details</li>
    <li>Email address and phone number</li>
    <li>Booking and travel information</li>
    <li>Payment-related details</li>
    <li>Location and device information</li>
    <li>User reviews and feedback</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

  <p>Your information is used to:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Process hotel and stay bookings</li>
    <li>Improve user experience</li>
    <li>Send booking confirmations and updates</li>
    <li>Provide customer support</li>
    <li>Maintain website security</li>
    <li>Offer personalized recommendations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Cookies</h2>

  <p>
    WanderStay may use cookies and similar technologies to improve website
    performance and personalize your experience.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data Protection</h2>

  <p>
    We implement security measures to protect your personal data from
    unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>

  <p>
    We may use trusted third-party services such as payment gateways,
    analytics tools, and booking partners. These services may collect data
    according to their own privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>6. User Rights</h2>

  <p>You have the right to:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Access your personal information</li>
    <li>Request corrections or updates</li>
    <li>Delete your account and data</li>
    <li>Opt out of marketing emails</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>

  <p>
    WanderStay does not knowingly collect personal information from children
    under 13 years of age.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>

  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be
    posted on this page with the updated date.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>

  <p>
    If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
  </p>

  <p>
    Email:
    <a href="mailto:support@wanderstay.com">
      support@wanderstay.com
    </a>
  </p>

  <div class="privacy-footer">
    © 2026 WanderStay. All Rights Reserved.
  </div>

</div>
